From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 16:20:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Add unit and functional test suite (65 tests, 0 failures)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Unit tests:
  - test_auth.py: API key hashing, generation, prefix masking, validation
  - test_connector_utils.py: safe_upsert insert/update/empty/purge/cross-tenant
  - test_executor.py: company_id scoping, cross-tenant isolation, dry_run
  - test_scheduler.py: per-tenant cooldown, cooldown windows, status filtering
  - test_security.py: SEC-NEW-001/003 — no backdoor routes, no global credentials

Functional tests:
  - test_api.py: health, auth, customers, execute, dashboard, connector endpoints
  - test_agent_cycle.py: scheduler/executor isolation, multi-tenant independence

All tests use in-memory SQLite — no Railway DB required.
Run: pytest tests/ -v

